 G  T  H  A  O\n\n2  2  /  0  4  /  1  9  6  9\n\n1  8  6  8  9  8  4  7  5  7  1  6\n\nDIEN THOAI  0634935394\n\nDIA CHI THUONG TRU  210 PHAN XICH LONG, TAN THUAN DONG, 7, TPHCM\n\nNGHE NGHIEP  CONG NHAN VIEN\n\nAN BINH HUU TRI (SAN PHAM CHINH - BAO HIEM HUU  25 NAM  684,000,000  10,686,000\n\nTRI)\n\nTRONG 5 NAM GAN DAY, CO TUNG  KHONG\n\nNAM VIEN, PHAU THUAT HOAC DIEU\n\nTRI NOI TRU?\n\nDANG DUNG THUOC THEO CHI DINH  KHONG\n\nDAI NGAY?\n\nHUT THUOC LA / SU DUNG DO UONG  KHONG\n\nCO CON THUONG XUYEN?\n\nTHAM GIA HOAT DONG, NGHE NGHIEP  KHONG\n\nCO TINH RUI RO CAO?\n\nDA TUNG BI TU CHOI / TANG PHI /  KHONG\n\nLOAI TRU KHI THAM GIA BAO HIEM?\n\nCAM KET CUA NGUOI YEU CAU BAO HIEM\n\nTOI XAC NHAN MOI THONG TIN KE KHAI TRONG DON NAY LA DAY DU, TRUNG THUC VA CHINH XAC; DAY LA CAN CU DE DOANH\n\nNGHIEP BAO HIEM XEM XET CHAP NHAN BAO HIEM VA PHAT HANH HOP DONG. TOI DONG Y CHO DOANH NGHIEP BAO HIEM\n\nTHU THAP, XAC MINH THONG TIN SUC KHOE VA TAI CHINH PHUC VU VIEC THAM DINH.\n\nBEN MUA BAO HIEM  TU VAN VIEN\n\n(KY, GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY, GHI MA SO)\n\nMOI SUA CHUA TREN GIAY UY QUYEN PHAI CO CHU KY XAC NHAN CUA BEN UY QUYEN\n\nGIAY UY QUYEN PHAI KEM BAN SAO GIAY TO TUY THAN CUA CA HAI BEN", "html": "<p>CONG TY TNHH BAO HIEM NHAN THO VIET TIN 00067684</p>\n<h1>DON YEU CAU BAO HIEM</h1>\n<p>N G U Y E N T H I P H U O N G T H A O</p>\n<p>2 2 / 0 4 / 1 9 6 9</p>\n<p>1 8 6 8 9 8 4 7 5 7 1 6</p>\n<p>DIEN THOAI 0634935394</p>\n<p>DIA CHI THUONG TRU 210 PHAN XICH LONG, TAN THUAN DONG, 7, TPHCM</p>\n<p>NGHE NGHIEP CONG NHAN VIEN</p>\n<p>AN BINH HUU TRI (SAN PHAM CHINH - BAO HIEM HUU 25 NAM 684,000,000 10,686,000</p>\n<p>TRI)</p>\n<p>TRONG 5 NAM GAN DAY, CO TUNG KHONG</p>\n<p>NAM VIEN, PHAU THUAT HOAC DIEU</p>\n<p>TRI NOI TRU?</p>\n<p>DANG DUNG THUOC THEO CHI DINH KHONG</p>\n<p>DAI NGAY?</p>\n<p>HUT THUOC LA / SU DUNG DO UONG KHONG</p>\n<p>CO CON THUONG XUYEN?</p>\n<p>THAM GIA HOAT DONG, NGHE NGHIEP KHONG</p>\n<p>CO TINH RUI RO CAO?</p>\n<p>DA TUNG BI TU CHOI / TANG PHI / KHONG</p>\n<p>